{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24515","headline":"时热少客因咏所怀 · 白居易","name":"时热少客因咏所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冠栉心多懒，逢迎兴渐微。\n况当时热甚，幸遇客来稀。\n湿洒池边地，凉开竹下扉。\n露牀青篾簟，风架白蕉衣。\n院静留僧宿，楼空放妓归。\n衰残强欢宴，此事久知非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}